{'symbol': 'CF', 'date': '2023-02-14 16:30:00', 'title': 'CF INDUSTRIES ANNOUNCES PURCHASE OF 2.2 BILLION CUBIC FEET OF NATURAL GAS CERTIFIED BY MIQ TO HAVE 90% LOWER METHANE EMISSIONS INTENSITY THAN INDUSTRY AVERAGE', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL, & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS PART OF ITS COMMITMENT TO REDUCE ITS SCOPE 3 EMISSIONS BY 10% BY 2030 AND TO REDUCE THE LIFECYCLE CARBON INTENSITY OF AMMONIA PRODUCTION, CF INDUSTRIES HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE: CF) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH BP (NYSE: BP) FOR THE SUPPLY OF 2.2 BILLION CUBIC FEET (BCF) OF CERTIFIED NATURAL GAS IN 2023.'}